;THE RNA MOLECULE IS NUMBERED FROM 1 - 19 IN THE ENTRY. IN
PUBLICATIONS, THE NUMBERING IS RELATED TO THE BEGINNING
OF THE INITIATION CODON OF THE REPLICASE GENE (+1). THUS,
RESIDUES 1 - 15 IN THE ENTRY CORRESPOND TO -15 - -1, AND
RESIDUES 16 - 19 CORRESPOND TO +1 - +4.
